  protocol/client, gateway and local test facilitator integration.
- Original synthetic research fixtures: CC0-1.0 dedication in
  services/gateway/fixtures/research/LICENSE.md. Fictional demo data only.
- Brand logos in apps/dashboard/public/logos: SVGs from svgl (MIT,
